{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_080_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "380f57206a288731cfc76d4f36c5d7a22615d56157974cca195446167c00db53", "ja": "はい。ブログには今の私の、正直な気持ちを\n書いたつもりなんですけど……。", "zh": "是的。我本来是想在博客上写下自己现在真实的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_080_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "dc2e68f58112c6f38fcb854359364396495c40c87e6a6adb0a50218dde05efbb", "ja": "あんまり正直すぎて、{$P$}に\n一言相談した方がよかったかなって……。", "zh": "可能有点太坦白了，\n我在想是不是该先跟{$P$}商量一下的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
