{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_080_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "e3982542f9d4b833d9f937bd14711790a6b3f845123943ea4d0a0e8117c1f0cc", "ja": "あっ……そういえば、この前のファンの子から、\nまたお手紙が届いたんですよ！", "zh": "啊……说起来，之前那位粉丝又寄来信了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_080_1008_p", "source_sha256": "eb9058cf4d9b86294fe6e892ee9fd26d217884119538e401ecef5666e96aa0b6", "ja": "おっ、そうか！　なんて書いてあったんだ？", "zh": "哦，这样啊！信上写了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_080_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "45f7649f51a2c5987e2043672f5356ee9f78c4c62da18a6aeb098413801f1b37", "ja": "はい！\n「やっぱり、紗代子ちゃんが大好き」……って！", "zh": "是！写的是“果然，我最喜欢纱代子了”……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_080_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "02de997c8617b61753d923c70de6ed1539ed9acba42852640e4c4c8df2e3c109", "ja": "私、今までステージに立つ時は、弱い私をメガネと\n一緒に置いてこなくちゃって思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "我以前一直觉得，站上舞台的时候，必须把软弱的自己连同眼镜一起留在台下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_080_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "3822ccaf02230ab587d107458f2191001eebf7b098a4e875049e97c849c1516c", "ja": "もしも叶うなら、弱い私とも、\n一緒に走れたらいいなって。そうすれば……。", "zh": "要是可以的话，我也想和软弱的自己\n一起奔跑。如果能这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
